Conclusion

The Sales Analysis Dashboard demonstrates how data visualization can transform raw sales data into meaningful and interactive business information.
Using Microsoft Power BI, the dashboard combines KPI cards, charts, tables and interactive slicers to provide a comprehensive view of sales performance. It allows users to analyze sales trends, regional performance, product categories, top-performing products and customer-level sales.
The project demonstrates that effective data visualization is not simply about presenting graphs. It is about presenting information in a way that helps users understand patterns, identify important trends and make informed decisions.
Overall, this assignment provided practical experience in data visualization, data analysis, interactive filtering and dashboard design using Power BI.
